# Bridge segment: a ROAD segment on a deck (a cable of the conveyor medium, isCableType): one 2 m grid cell, painted
# like the road, in the road's runs, walked by the carriers. It stands on WATER: over a river, a lake or the sea its
# origin is 0.25 above the water surface (StructureSystem::groundFit) - a road's origin over its ground.
# The DECK (CubeQuarter, 0.5 m thick) is moved down 0.35: its top is 0.15 m over the water, a step a body walks up.
# Its collider is real (no Layer Cable): players and units stand on it.
# SHAPE: planks, and a PIER under the middle (three render-only pieces, 1.2 m wide, down to 11 m under the deck; it
# is in the ground on land). Scale is uniform, so the pier is stacked pieces, not one stretched one.
Prefab gameBridge
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node CubeQuarter
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.5 0.36 0.2
		Position 0 -0.35 0
		Scale 1
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 0.25 1
		Offset 0 -0.35 0
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 1
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Pier1
			Position 0 -2.4 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Pillar3
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.36 0.26 0.15
				Scale 0.6
		Entity
			Name Pier2
			Position 0 -6.0 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Pillar3
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.36 0.26 0.15
				Scale 0.6
		Entity
			Name Pier3
			Position 0 -9.6 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Pillar3
				Type StaticMesh
